### Settlements — approve (expects 200 OK)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@id = 1

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/settlements/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "state": "approved"
}

### Settlements — pay (expects 200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/settlements/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "state": "paid",
  "observations": "Pagado por transferencia el 3 de octubre"
}

### Settlements — invalid transition paid → pending (expects 409 Conflict)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/settlements/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "state": "pending"
}

### Settlements — change the period of a paid settlement (expects 409 Conflict)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/settlements/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "periodEnd": "2026-10-02"
}
